# Safegloss Story + Quiz Engine Architecture Diagrams

## 1) End-to-end flow (Story → Quiz → Objectives/Standards → Delivery)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Teacher Story Request\n(age, genre, Lexile, theme, length,\nstyle profile, study/exam, vocab mode)] --> B[Writing Profile Builder\nmerge rules: age + genre + lexile\n+ style + ELL + vocab overlays]
  B --> C[Prompt Composer\nrule phrasing + layered prompt]
  C --> D[LLM Story Generation]
  D --> E[Story Validation Loop\nsentence length, clauses,\npassive voice, vocab heuristics]
  E -->|fails| C
  E -->|passes| F[Story Stored\n+ profile + metrics + audit]

  F --> G[Objective Extractor\nsystem-generated learning objectives\n(Bloom + comprehension types)]
  G --> H[Objective Filter\nage-appropriate Bloom + coverage]
  H --> I[Quiz Prompt Composer\nobjectives + corpora-style constraints\n+ item-type mix]
  I --> J[LLM Quiz Generation\nJSON items]
  J --> K[Quiz Validation & Repair\nschema + Bloom + linguistic + psychometric]
  K -->|fails| I
  K -->|passes| L[Quiz Stored\n+ traceability + metrics]

  L --> M[Delivery\nStudy Mode: hints/explanations\nExam Mode: restricted feedback]